description:
  Verifies that long plain-text and markdown node/edge labels auto-wrap onto
  multiple lines when markdownAutoWrap is true and htmlLabels is true. Split
  from a single upstream test that rendered three config variants side by side
  into this standalone fixture.
config:
  markdownAutoWrap: true
  htmlLabels: true
title: "Testing with {\"markdownAutoWrap\":true,\"htmlLabels\":true}"
